# 一律按 LF 存进仓库，检出也保持 LF：
# 脚本要给 Linux 上的 GitHub Actions / Cloudflare 跑，CRLF 会让 shebang 与 bash 语法出错
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制不要做换行转换，也不要在 diff 里当文本展开
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary

# SVG 是文本，但 diff 没意义
*.svg text diff=false

# 这些文件按纯文本看，不要折叠缩进
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.toml text
*.json text
*.md text
*.sh text
*.sql text
